        "TileImage": "$($repository 672a7a52-a08a-45cd-a061-ced6a7b8d8c4).Image",
        "Description": "Janus was a legendary KGB spymaster during the Cold War. After Brezhnev&apos;s ascent, he came to view the conflict as pointless, and in 1988 left the KGB after falling afoul of the administration. Though the Soviet Union is no more, his defection still rankles many former KGB agents, some of whom now occupy high-ranking positions in the Russian Federation. The ICA has been contracted by these men to make Janus embrace communism one last time...\r\rAlso, you have to wear BBQ clothes for some reason.",
